{"cluster_id": "C-3755", "topic": "The `ca-fsck` summary previously omitted `corrupted_runs` from its rendered summ", "target": "operations/debugging", "member_ids": ["AUDIT-M2-360"], "canonical_claim": "The `ca-fsck` summary previously omitted `corrupted_runs` from its rendered summary line and exit code even though it was counted and part of `clean()`, so a failing seal checksum was invisible twice over; the summary line was moved into `Cas::formatFsckSummary` (reachable from a unit test) with `corrupted_runs` added.", "issue_ids": [], "sources": ["docs/superpowers/reports/2026-07-26-list-incompleteness-investigation.md#L343-L348"]}
